  iepTitle:'How are things now?',iepLead:'Record your feelings, attention, and effort. Scales have no automatically selected answers.',oopTitle:'What can you observe?',oopLead:'Separate the observable situation from expectations. Uncertainty is a valid answer.',reviewTitle:'Review and save',reviewLead:'Only a completed observation enters your history. Until then, these answers remain a draft.',step:'Step',of:'of',iep:'State and effort',oop:'Observable outcome',review:'Review',
