  intentional:'Are you deliberately changing your intention?',yes:'Yes, I want to change it',no:'No, keep it as it is',unsure:'I am not sure yet',revisionHint:'Complete only the parts you want to change. These answers update your starting point after the observation is saved.',cieConfirm:'I confirm that my saved intention reflects its current state.',cieHint:'Review your starting point before a new observation. Confirmation is your explicit answer.',next:'Continue',complete:'Save completed observation',saved:'Saved in this browser',saving:'Saving draft…',unsaved:'Latest changes are not saved',savedObservation:'Observation saved. Your intention’s history is updated.',allRequired:'Complete all six intention fields with your own answers.',requiredAnswers:'Choose all required answers on this step. Zero is a valid answer; an empty field is not.',evidenceRequired:'Choose at least one basis, including “Not enough information” if that is your answer.',intentionalRequired:'Choose whether you want to deliberately change your intention.',revisionRequired:'Enter at least one part of the intention to change.',cieRequired:'Confirm your current starting point before continuing.',
